@@s024 At the exam
@@s025 Multiplication of large integers → Karatsuba, <code>O(n^log₂3)</code>. Sorting on average → randomised quicksort, O(n log n) expected. Phrase: <i>"Karatsuba uses three recursive multiplications of half size, so T(n) = 3T(n/2) + O(n) = O(n^1.585)."</i>
